                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The fourth tab the strip has always promised and no frame ever drew. Derived from the loop face, changing only what the stage changes: the coordinate loses its lane, because a track bus sits downstream of all of them, and the chain feeds the master sum rather than the track mix. A card still carries its monitor line only when a rack is loaded \u2014 the vacant one omits it here for the same reason it does on the loop face."
              }
